<h1>Warehouse B</h1>
<p class="lead">Only members of the Entra group <code>AccessCode-ADVCD02</code> can see this page.</p>
<p>Authorization is the policy <code>WarehouseB</code>, which requires the claim <code>access_code = ADVCD02</code>. That claim is added at sign-in by resolving the <code>groups</code> claim of the ID token.</p>
